{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.poster.avif?t=1773834412\" width=1144 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.webm?t=1773834412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.mp4?t=1773834412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600990/extras/6916c0328d8785773dccaa39dd0fa4fc.avif?t=1773834412\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REEL TO THE BEAT!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reeling is essential, and you must reel to the beat of the song!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch several fishes each with their own original song!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro 3D graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals inspired by early 2000's aesthetics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are affected by the power of the mermaid, and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features \u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Rhythm gameplay! - Fishing in this game will be to the beat of the song and you must maintain the line tension at all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make melodies along with the music! - Reeling in this game will also play melodies along with the music. Making music feels unique every time you fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many strange environments! - You may get to fish in a place that you never thought to fish before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange collection of fish! - Many fish aren't anything you've seen before! They can be quite strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future Planned features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom fish editor: create your own fish and song then release it in a community pond for other players to enjoy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Depth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600990/f9938a922ece080ec35e8b5fe656b2373939a9b8.jpg"},{"name":"Good Fish collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600990/a3782501f75fefaa78317fde7a8ba3156caf5afc.jpg"},{"name":"Great Catfish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3600990/821b5cc28675e55dc06ef4e478018b0df5981f0c.jpg"},{"name":"Metal Shark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps